Notes",[]],["Microfreak/Preset/293%20Digital%20Roads/","source-block-1062","Saved export and provenance",["Notes"]],["Microfreak/Preset/293%20Digital%20Roads/","source-block-1096","Saved export: read from the device's slot 293 over USB on October 25, 2026 with mise run microfreak:download --slot 293. Two consecutive reads returned the same file.",["Notes","Saved export and provenance"]],["Microfreak/Preset/293%20Digital%20Roads/","source-block-1269","The parameter payload matches the MIDI Control Center archives Factory 3.0, Factory 6.0 (Factory 3.0 slot 357, Factory 6.0 slot 27). Comparison used mise run microfreak:compare.",["Notes","Saved export and provenance"]],["Microfreak/Preset/293%20Digital%20Roads/","source-block-1453","Download the slot 293 capture. It is the raw device format (header plus data packets), not an .mbp file; see .",["Notes","Saved export and provenance"]],["Microfreak/Preset/293%20Digital%20Roads/","source-block-1782","Oscillator",["Notes"]],["Microfreak/Preset/293%20Digital%20Roads/","source-block-1799","Model: Bass. Microfreak/UG/06 Dig Osc/03 Types/14 BASS",["Notes","Oscillator"]],["Microfreak/Preset/293%20Digital%20Roads/","source-block-1951","Saturate: 0.194. Fold: 0.285. Noise: 0.309.",["Notes","Oscillator"]],["Microfreak/Preset/293%20Digital%20Roads/","source-block-2160","Keyboard octave: 0. Glide: 0.000.",["Notes","Oscillator"]],["Microfreak/Preset/293%20Digital%20Roads/","source-block-2302","Filter",["Notes"]],["Microfreak/Preset/293%20Digital%20Roads/","source-block-2315","Band-pass filter. Saved cutoff: 0.380; resonance: 0.952. Microfreak/UG/07 Filter/01 Modifying Sound/02 Band Pass Filter",["Notes","Filter"]],["Microfreak/Preset/293%20Digital%20Roads/","source-block-2654","Envelopes",["Notes"]],["Microfreak/Preset/293%20Digital%20Roads/","source-block-2670","Main envelope: attack 0.165, decay/release 0.596, sustain 0.399. Amp Mod is on, so the main envelope controls loudness. Microfreak/UG/09 Envelope Gen/03 Envelope Stages",["Notes","Envelopes"]],["Microfreak/Preset/293%20Digital%20Roads/","source-block-3114","Cycling Envelope mode: Run. Stored RiseLvl 0.322, RiseSlp 0.500, FallLvl 0.410, FallSlp 0.500, Hold 0.000, Amount 0.000. Microfreak/UG/09 Envelope Gen/06 Cycling Envelope",["Notes","Envelopes"]],["Microfreak/Preset/293%20Digital%20Roads/","source-block-3875","LFO",["Notes"]],["Microfreak/Preset/293%20Digital%20Roads/","source-block-3885","Sample-and-Hold, clock sync off; stored normalized rate: 0.118. Microfreak/UG/08 LFO/01 LFO Shape · Microfreak/UG/08 LFO/02 LFO Rate",["Notes","LFO"]],["Microfreak/Preset/293%20Digital%20Roads/","source-block-4229","Modulation matrix",["Notes"]],["Microfreak/Preset/293%20Digital%20Roads/","source-block-4253","Amounts use the signed normalized range −1…+1. Microfreak/UG/05 Connections/02 Matrix and Encoder/01 Sources and Destinations",["Notes","Modulation matrix"]],["Microfreak/Preset/293%20Digital%20Roads/","source-block-4444","Cycling Envelope → Pitch: +0.002.",["Notes","Modulation matrix"]],["Microfreak/Preset/293%20Digital%20Roads/","source-block-4543","LFO → Pitch: −0.003.",["Notes","Modulation matrix"]],["Microfreak/Preset/293%20Digital%20Roads/","source-block-4620","LFO → Wave: +0.157.",["Notes","Modulation matrix"]],["Microfreak/Preset/293%20Digital%20Roads/","source-block-4736","Cycling Envelope → Timbre: +0.992.",["Notes","Modulation matrix"]],["Microfreak/Preset/293%20Digital%20Roads/","source-block-4880","ENV → Cutoff: +0.251.",["Notes","Modulation matrix"]],["Microfreak/Preset/293%20Digital%20Roads/","source-block-5029","PRESSURE → Cutoff: −0.065.",["Notes","Modulation matrix"]],["Microfreak/Preset/293%20Digital%20Roads/","source-block-5171","KEY/ARP → Cutoff: +1.000.",["Notes","Modulation matrix"]],["Microfreak/Preset/293%20Digital%20Roads/","source-block-5310","LFO → Assign 1 → Cycling Envelope Amount: +0.179.",["Notes","Modulation matrix"]],["Microfreak/Preset/293%20Digital%20Roads/","source-block-5549","PRESSURE → Assign 2 → Filter Resonance: +0.009.",["Notes","Modulation matrix"]],["Microfreak/Preset/293%20Digital%20Roads/","source-block-5777","All other saved matrix amounts are zero.",["Notes","Modulation matrix"]],["Microfreak/Preset/293%20Digital%20Roads/","source-block-5822","Voice and keyboard",["Notes"]],["Microfreak/Preset/293%20Digital%20Roads/","source-block-5847","Paraphonic mode: on.",["Notes","Voice and keyboard"]],["Microfreak/Preset/293%20Digital%20Roads/","source-block-5931","Performance and session context",["Notes"]],["Microfreak/Preset/293%20Digital%20Roads/","source-block-5969","A paraphonic Bass oscillator through a resonant band-pass filter. Key position drives cutoff at full depth, so higher notes sound brighter. A sample-and-hold LFO nudges Saturate and the Cycling Envelope amount, and the Cycling Envelope is routed to Fold.",["Notes","Performance and session context"]],["Microfreak/Preset/293%20Digital%20Roads/","source-block-6287","In GitP/A/Session/26/11/22-Sun, Digital Roads is on the fourth Launchpad/Sequencer track, and its take records from 05:28 to 09:02. Early in the take, the session MIDI records the Cycling Envelope's Rise and Fall, Attack, Decay/Release and Filter Amt. Then Shape, Timbre and Wave move by 06:00; on Bass these knobs set Noise, Fold and Saturate. The track's pattern is played in from the MicroFreak's keys between 07:04 and 08:16.",["Notes","Performance and session context"]],["Microfreak/Preset/293%20Digital%20Roads/","source-block-7269","The October capture documents the factory settings, before those moves.",["Notes","Performance and session context"]],["Microfreak/Preset/293%20Digital%20Roads/","source-block-7345","Evidence and interpretation",["Notes"]],["Microfreak/Preset/293%20Digital%20Roads/","source-block-7379","Values describe saved base settings before modulation. Controls use normalized 0…1 values unless a stored choice code is shown; they are not OLED percentages, hertz or milliseconds.",["Notes","Evidence and interpretation"]],["Microfreak/Preset/293%20Digital%20Roads/","source-block-7567","Microfreak/CLI/Inspect a preset preserves the original fields. Oscillator interpretation assumes the documented firmware 5 layout; firmware is not detected from the export.",["Notes","Evidence and interpretation"]],["Microfreak/Preset/293%20Digital%20Roads/","source-block-7748","Matrix assignments follow the Freakout live map. Mode, LFO shape, filter type and octave labels follow the MicroFreak Reader definitions.",["Notes","Evidence and interpretation"]],["Microfreak/Preset/294%20Synchronizer/","source-block-553","Notes",[]],["Microfreak/Preset/295%20Tactile%20Techno/","source-block-1051","Notes",[]],["Microfreak/Preset/295%20Tactile%20Techno/","source-block-1061","Saved export and provenance",["Notes"]],["Microfreak/Preset/295%20Tactile%20Techno/","source-block-1095","Saved export: read from the device's slot 295 over USB on October 25, 2026 with mise run microfreak:download --slot 295. Two consecutive reads returned the same file.",["Notes","Saved export and provenance"]],["Microfreak/Preset/295%20Tactile%20Techno/","source-block-1268","The parameter payload matches the MIDI Control Center archives Factory 3.0, Factory 6.0 (Factory 3.0 slot 359, Factory 6.0 slot 5). Comparison used mise run microfreak:compare.",["Notes","Saved export and provenance"]],["Microfreak/Preset/295%20Tactile%20Techno/","source-block-1451","Download the slot 295 capture. It is the raw device format (header plus data packets), not an .mbp file; see .",["Notes","Saved export and provenance"]],["Microfreak/Preset/295%20Tactile%20Techno/","source-block-1782","Oscillator",["Notes"]],["Microfreak/Preset/295%20Tactile%20Techno/","source-block-1799","Model: SawX. Microfreak/UG/06 Dig Osc/03 Types/15 SAWX",["Notes","Oscillator"]],["Microfreak/Preset/295%20Tactile%20Techno/","source-block-1951","Saw Mod: 0.000. Shape: 0.762. Noise: 0.116.",["Notes","Oscillator"]],["Microfreak/Preset/295%20Tactile%20Techno/","source-block-2160","Keyboard 